es character was instantly  recognizable 60 years later was a  reminder of how familiar he was in their  heyday Impressionists all did Kirk  Douglas because the whole world knew him  drill a hole and his acting style of  barely contained rage Douglass loved it  to say he had a long career is an  understatement  my wife even approaching 100 he was  still active with many charities his  legacy includes his son Michael Douglas  himself a famous actor I'll see it  simply with all my heart I'm so proud to  be yourself one of the last stars from  Hollywood's golden era moviegoers knew  what they were getting in a Kirk Douglas  film and they loved what they got from  Kirk Douglas  Eric Sorenson global news  still ahead the crash lining in Turkey  and house cause of passengers were  forced to escape plus air being these  new house rules for younger clients  after a deadly shooting  Airbnb is introducing new restrictions  on young renters in Canada in the wake  of a deadly shooting at a downtown  Toronto condo  the pilot policy will prohibit people  under the age of 25  from renting homes within their own  community unless there's a host on the  premises the move is meant to prevent  unauthorised house parties and does not  apply when people are renting outside  their community in this particular case  as it relates to Canada our research  shows that those incidents involving  unauthorized parties do significantly  over-index  with people under the age of 25 doing on  hosted stays within the communities that  they live in three people died last  Friday in a shooting at a downtown  Toronto condo that had been rented out  on Airbnb a fourth man was hospitalized  with serious gunshot wounds all of the  victims were between the ages of 19 and  22 Canada has demanded Iran hand over  the black boxes from the wreckage of the  Ukrainian passenger plane that Iran's  military shot down last month all 176  people on board died including 57  Canadians Canada's foreign affairs  minister 